OL,4,CMan dies putting up shopping centre    
OL,5,Cfestive lights                         
OL,6,GA man in his 40s has died after an     
OL,7,Gincident involving the installation of 
OL,8,GChristmas lights at Brent Cross        
OL,9,GShopping Centre in north-west London.  
OL,11,FEmergency services were called to the  
OL,12,Fcentre in Prince Charles Drive,        
OL,13,FHendon, shortly after 05:00 GMT on     
OL,14,FWednesday. The man, who had been       
OL,15,Fcarrying out work at the shopping      
OL,16,Fcentre, was taken to hospital but died 
OL,17,Fthe following day, the Metropolitan    
OL,18,FPolice said.                           
